<title>RUSSIA: Russia RTS shares index rises to record 312.60.</title>
<headline>Russia RTS shares index rises to record 312.60.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System 24-share equity index closed at a record 312.60 on Tuesday, rising 2.5 percent from 304.90 on Monday on $50 million turnover for the entire market, the NAUFOR brokers' association said.</p>
</text>
